The bin/em-*.sh toolbelt scripts are adaptations of firstmate's fm-*.sh
scripts (renamed fm-* -> em-*), with two exceptions that are original to
this project by locked scoping decision (see PRD.md):

  - bin/em-worktree.sh  replaces firstmate's "treehouse" worktree pool with
    plain `git worktree` operations.
  - bin/em-validate.sh  (arrives in milestone M3) replaces firstmate's
    "no-mistakes" pipeline with a minimal test + lint gate.

